        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'Below half health: get away — its escape ability (EnemyData › Kit › Escape: Phase Shift, Ambush, Echo…), else full cover, else just run — and lie low a moment. At most every 12 s. Interrupts the fight below it.'
